    [Misc] main2main 0930 c4df37d (#18465)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    Bump the verified vLLM main pin from `8cc9aa5` to `c4df37df` and adapt
    vllm-ascend to the upstream changes in that range. The v0.30.0 release
    lane is
    kept intact: each adaptation is gated on `vllm_version_is("0.30.0")` (or
    a
    version-aware helper) so both the `main` and the `v0.30.0` CPU UT lanes
    stay
    green.
    
    The range contains three breaking upstream changes plus one release-lane
    fix:
    
    - vllm#58947 reworked the scheduler waiting queues.
    - vllm#58400 extended the MRV2 `InputBatch`/`BatchReqState` contract.
    - vllm#53934 turned `CudaGraphManager.dp_size` into a property and
    changed
      `EPLBController.maybe_register_model`.
    - The Ascend Qwen3.5-VL NPU-preprocessing feature imported a main-only
    fused
      input norm, breaking the release lane.
    
